{"kind":"stack","id":"soils-1","title":"Soils: made from rocks and living things","theme":{"background":"#f5efe0","foreground":"#3b2f1e","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Soil"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"The top layer of the ground. It is made from broken-up rock and decayed plants and animals."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What is soil mostly made from?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Broken-up rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Melted glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Sand from the sea only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What is humus?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Decayed plants and animals","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Fresh water in the soil","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Tiny pieces of metal","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"Organic matter"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-e","content":"Material that was once alive, such as leaves, roots and dead animals. It helps soil hold water and feeds plants."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which part of soil comes from living things?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Organic matter","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Grains of rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Air pockets","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You are digging a hole in the school garden. The soil is dark and crumbly. Do you dig deeper or look at the soil you have already dug up?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Dig deeper","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Look at the soil","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You find pale stones deeper down. They are bits of the rock that soil was made from. Well done for digging!"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You spot worms and dead leaves in the soil. These are living things and decayed matter. Great eyes!"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why is soil good for plants?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"It holds water and food for roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"It is always completely dry","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"It is made of glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"What is the main job of tiny living things in soil?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Breaking down dead matter","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Turning rock into metal","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Making the soil colder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the soils lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Soil is made from rock and living matter. Keep looking closely at the ground around you."}],"actions":[]}}
